cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=library-slide
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 1
# Docked: in by the button, out by the back arrow, both on the spring.
cra://action/openLibrary
expect-log library button: opens it slide\(to: 1\.0\)$
wait 1.5
expect-log library slid in on [1-9][0-9]+ frames
cra://debug?libraryBack=1
expect-log library back arrow: pressed
expect-log library button: leaves it slide\(to: 0\.0\)$
wait 1.5
expect-log library slid out on [1-9][0-9]+ frames
# Hidden and out over the page: in from the window's edge under the floating sidebar, landing docked.
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=hold
wait 1
cra://action/openLibrary
expect-log library button: opens it slideFromHidden, the floating sidebar out
wait 1.5
expect-log library slid in from the hidden sidebar on [1-9][0-9]+ frames
expect-log library swipe from the hidden sidebar: lands docked 417 pt wide
cra://debug?windowState=in
expect-log window state in: main0 .* lightsHidden=0 .* floating=none
# Its back arrow slides it back out to the hidden sidebar, with no tab list on the way.
cra://debug?libraryBack=1
expect-log library button: leaves it slide\(to: 0\.0\) to the hidden sidebar
wait 1.5
expect-log library slid out to the hidden sidebar on [1-9][0-9]+ frames
